This repository implements a modular Lua Runtime target aligned with the CDIN
Specification. It no longer bundles a verbatim copy of the legacy CDIN
`data/core/` source tree or source-reference snapshots. The architecture and API
contracts are documented in `docs/`. See `LICENSE` for the GNU GPL v3-or-later
license terms.

Third-party names such as Lua, CDIN Kernel, SDL and the CDIN Specification are
references to their respective projects; this notice does not alter their
